task_contract.stop_rule:
Stop before implementation if Phase 6 final payload removes or renames the listed fields, if client-side score derivation is required to make the UI work,
if the minimal card requires a new layout or new visual system, if server audit export parity becomes an owner requirement, or if the task exceeds 10 files,
500 incremental lines, or three implementation cycles. Surface the split instead of expanding this phase silently.
